<section class="ml-hero"><div class="ml-w ml-hero-g"><div class="ml-hero-t"><p class="ml-scr">the art of the hat</p><h1>Millery</h1><p class="ml-lead">Fedoras, berets, boaters and sun hats, explained by people who love them. Find your size, the shape that suits your face and the way to keep a good hat for decades.</p><div class="ml-hero-a"><a class="ml-btn" href="#size">Find my hat size</a><a class="ml-lnk" href="hat-styles-guide.html">Browse hat styles</a></div></div>
<div class="ml-stage"><div class="ml-frame"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1774507195095-962b10621f85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=560&h=700&q=75" alt="a woman in a wide-brimmed hat and floral dress by the water" width="560" height="700" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="ml-boxes" aria-hidden="true"><div class="ml-box b1"><i class="lid"></i><i class="bx"></i></div><div class="ml-box b2"><i class="lid"></i><i class="bx"></i></div></div><span class="ml-tag" aria-hidden="true">Made<br>by hand</span></div></div></section>

